SUMMARY:Neptune Diner Meetup July!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWe will be meeting for brunch a
 t a local diner! This one is a bit later in the morning than usual for tho
 se who like to sleep in!\n\nNeptune Diner\n924 N. Prince St.\nLancaster PA
  17603\n\nNeptune Diner is on the right side of the one-way Prince St. It 
 has its own sizable parking lot adjacent. If you pass the Baseball stadium
  you've gone too far!\n\nWe look forward to seeing you!
