SUMMARY:LFS Monthly Discussion - El Serrano's
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nCome joins us for intelligent d
 iscussion and freethinking fun at our monthly meeting. Lancaster Freethoug
 ht Society is a community for Freethinkers\, Atheists\, Agnostics\, Humani
 sts\, Non-believers\, Skeptics\, and those who are simply curious. There i
 s no fee to attend our meetings which range from topical subjects of inter
 est to freethinkers such as Church/State Separation\, as well as subjects 
 such as science\, philosophy\, ethics\, counter-apologetics\, and psycholo
 gy. All are welcome to attend no matter what your beliefs may be but prose
 lytizing is not allowed. Bring your articles\, news\, jokes\, gripes\, que
 stions\, ideas\, topics\, or anything else you would like to discuss with 
 the rest of the group.\n\nHope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315379230/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260623T041816Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260623T041816Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_ddwdztyjclbrb@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260705T040630Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T193000
SUMMARY:Patriarchy\, Matriarchy & Democracy: A Two-Part Online Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis is an LFS online discussio
 n series\, to be held on Google Meet.\nAcross two sessions\, we’ll explo
 re how patriarchy and matriarchy organize power\, care\, law\, family\, se
 x\, money\, violence\, and democracy.\n\nWe’ll use consciousness-raising
  style discussion rules: speak personally\, listen carefully\, don’t int
 errupt\, and don’t debate someone while they are speaking.\n\nThis is no
 t a lecture. It is a structured conversation about power\, equality\, fami
 ly\, sex\, law\, care\, violence\, democracy\, and what kind of world we w
 ant to build.\n\n**Google Meet link:**\nThe Google Meet link will be sent 
 just prior to the event and only to members who RSVP “Yes.” Please RSV
 P if you plan to attend.\n\n**Part 1\, Thursday August 6**\, we'’ll expl
 ore 3 questions\n\n1. What is patriarchy?\n2. What is matriarchy?\n3. How 
 do these systems operate?\n\n**Part 2: Thursday August 13**\, we'll explor
 e 3 questions\n\n* What are the benefits of each?\n* What are the dangers 
 or pitfalls of each?\n* Can democracy exist inside a patriarchy?\n\nFor ea
 ch question\, we’ll do a speaking round first. After everyone who wants 
 to speak has spoken\, Susan will offer brief evidence\, examples\, or defi
 nitions to deepen the discussion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 ddwdztyjclbrb/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T121916Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T121916Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
